## Running it in simulation

```
src/fpga/common/hcfpga_sim.py --algo @@ALGO@@ --bridge uartbone --build-only
src/fpga/common/hcfpga_sim.py --algo @@ALGO@@ --bridge uartbone --no-build --uart-port 2430 &
HCFPGA_LITEXBONE=tcp:127.0.0.1:2430 ./hashcat -m @@MODE@@ hash.txt words.txt
```

The bench, which needs Verilator only: `make -C src/fpga sim ALGO=@@ALGO@@`.
